<title>SINGAPORE: SingTel sells Sri Lankan broadcast stakes.</title>
<headline>SingTel sells Sri Lankan broadcast stakes.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Telecommunications Ltd (SingTel) said on Wednesday it had sold its stakes in Sri Lankan broadcasting companies MTV Channel (Private) Ltd and MBC Networks (Private) Ltd.</p>
<p>SingTel said in a statement it sold its 39.5 percent interest in MBC and its 50 percent in MTV. The statement gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
</text>
